   "id": "pmt/pure-core-1/ch2/q8",
   "question": "<figure class=\"practice-figure\" style=\"max-width:95mm;margin:2mm auto\"><img src=\"resources/pmt/pure-core-1-ch2/q08-fig-1.png\" alt=\"Figure 1: Argand diagram on a unit grid, Re from -5 to 1 and Im from -1 to 3, showing a shaded ring between two circles centred at -2 + i: the outer circle passes through -4 + i, 0 + i, -2 + 3i and -2 - i; the inner circle passes through -2 + 2i and -2 (on the real axis)\"></figure><p>Figure 1 shows an Argand diagram.</p><p>The set <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P\"></span>, of points that lie within the shaded region including its boundaries, is defined by</p><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"P=\\{z\\in\\mathbb C:a\\leqslant|z+b+c\\mathrm i|\\leqslant d\\}\" data-display=\"true\"></div><p>where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"c\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"d\"></span> are integers.</p><ol class=\"parts\" type=\"a\"><li>Write down the values of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"c\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"d\"></span>. <span class=\"marks\">(3)</span></li></ol><p>The set <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"Q\"></span> is defined by</p><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"Q=\\{z\\in\\mathbb C:a\\leqslant|z+b+c\\mathrm i|\\leqslant d\\}\\cap\\{z\\in\\mathbb C:|z-\\mathrm i|\\leqslant|z-3\\mathrm i|\\}\" data-display=\"true\"></div><ol class=\"parts\" type=\"a\" start=\"2\"><li>Determine the exact area of the region defined by <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"Q\"></span>, giving your answer in simplest form. <span class=\"marks\">(7)</span></li></ol>",
